      "content": "Update the paired post-save assertion as well: it still checks `not.toContain('1 Mark')`, which now passes even if the card incorrectly retains `To do: Mark` after saving. Assert the expected post-save remains text (or the absence of the new Mark wording) so this test continues to verify that the shared card's progress updates.",
