    {
      "path": "src/ui/screens/ReviewCard.tsx",
      "content": "The Plan column and At entry group are not necessarily duplicates. replay-series builds the former from the original planned risk/reward, whereas evaluation.atEntry measures actual open lots from their execution prices (including new fills after the expected close). With different fill prices or quantities, this condition silently removes distinct risk/reward figures. Suppress the group only when its displayed values actually match the Plan box, and add a test with differing planned and actual entry figures.",
      "existing_code": "  const planBoxCarriesAtEntry = trade.replay?.planColumn !== undefined \u0026\u0026 trade.evaluation?.atEntry != null;",
      "start_line": 326,
      "end_line": 326,
      "category": "bug",
      "severity": "medium"
    },
    {
      "path": "src/ui/app.css",
      "content": "Thesis and invalidation are user-entered text, but the new Plan box has no overflow wrapping. A long unbroken token (for example a pasted URL) overflows the constrained grid column and can introduce sideways scrolling at 375px; minmax(0, 1fr) limits the track, not the text. Add overflow-wrap: anywhere for the Plan text/values and cover a long-token case in the responsive test.",
      "existing_code": ".plan-box-why p {\n  margin: 0 0 0.25rem;\n}",
      "start_line": 1135,
      "end_line": 1137,
      "category": "bug",
      "severity": "medium"
    },
    {
      "path": "src/ui/screens/ReviewCard.tsx",
      "content": "Hardcoding `closeReview: false` loses the distinction already provided by the Trade's day line. When a walked Trade owes a Close Review, the day card says `To do: Close Review` but its header says `To do: Reflection`, contrary to the shared wording contract. Pass `line?.closeReview` through to this helper (while retaining progress-derived needs), and add coverage for a line with `closeReview: true`.",
      "existing_code": "  return todoText({ tradeId: '', marks: needed, closeReview: false, needs, ...(action !== undefined \u0026\u0026 { action }) });",
      "start_line": 54,
